# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
# 炼丹炉 RAG 系统 - 环境变量配置
# Alchemy Furnace RAG System - Environment
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── 数据库配置 ───
DB_HOST=postgres
DB_PORT=5432
DB_USER=alchemy
DB_PASSWORD=alchemy123
DB_NAME=alchemy_db

# ─── Qdrant 向量数据库 ───
QDRANT_HOST=qdrant
QDRANT_PORT=6333
QDRANT_COLLECTION=elixir_pills

# ─── LLM 配置 ───
# OpenAI 或兼容接口（如 DeepSeek、通义千问、智谱等）
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-api-key-here
OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
DEFAULT_MODEL=gpt-4o

# ─── Go API 网关 ───
GO_PORT=8080

# ─── Python RAG 引擎 ───
PYTHON_PORT=8000
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
CHUNK_SIZE=500
CHUNK_OVERLAP=50
TOP_K=5

# ─── 文件上传 ───
UPLOAD_DIR=/app/uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE=104857600

# ─── Nginx ───
NGINX_PORT=80
